"You can verify an output's GPIO pin number assignment easily. First, find "
"its hwdef.dat file `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" and determine the GPIO pin number listed beside its output number, as shown"
" below:"
msgstr ""
"您可以轻松验证输出的 GPIO 引脚编号分配。首先，在\\ `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" 找到其 hwdef.dat 文件，并确定其输出编号旁边列出的 GPIO 引脚编号，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:37 14f1d568464f40f59dcab8bd31d29182
msgid ""
"IOMCU \"MAIN\" output 1 thru 8 are mapped to GPIO pin numbers 101 to 108, "
"respectively."
msgstr "IOMCU 的「MAIN」输出 1 至 8 分别映射到 GPIO 引脚编号 101 至 108。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:39 8ba6507cc93d4118a27cc43fd6a1b8ff
msgid ""
"Usually, changing any feature or function's GPIO pin assignment will require"
" a reboot for it to take effect."
msgstr "通常，更改任何功能的 GPIO 引脚分配需要重启才能生效。"
